### Submit feedback
POST http://localhost:5000/api/feedbacks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "complaint",
  "subject": "Issue with product",
  "detail": "Details here",
  "customer_id": "{{customerId}}",
  "rating": 3
}

### Get all feedbacks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/feedbacks

### Get feedback by id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/feedbacks/{{feedbackId}}
